cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "regionbarcoder" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'regionbarcoder: Audit, Deploy, and Export Regional DNA Reference Databases'
version: 0.2.0
abstract: Provides tools to query, audit, export, assign amplicon sequence variants,
  and report regional DNA reference databases for ecological metabarcoding. The package
  supports local full YZFishDB SQLite releases and enables Yangtze River Basin fish
  eDNA ASV assignment against YZFishDB.
